GlassineOS kernel
=================

This branch is the kernel of GlassineOS (https://github.com/GlassineOS):
Linux 7.3 with the sdm660-mainline patches (https://github.com/sdm660-mainline/linux)
plus the patches, device trees and config fragments the GlassineOS images
build. sdm660-mainline has no 7.3 branch yet: its qcom-sdm660-7.2.y
(76320327ccdf) is rebased here onto v7.3 (base tip 4a62016f6636), without
the commits 7.3 already contains. When sdm660-mainline publishes
qcom-sdm660-7.3.y, the GlassineOS patches are rebased onto it.

Branches:
  glassine/sdm660-7.2        what the images build (Linux 7.2.3)
  glassine/sdm660-7.3        candidate for the images (not yet tested on a device)
  glassine/sdm660-7.3-debug  the same plus debug traces (not for daily use)

Build (arm64 cross compiler; GlassineOS uses ghcr.io/glassineos/kernel-build):

  make ARCH=arm64 CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu- O=out sdm660_defconfig onyx-noteair.config
  make ARCH=arm64 CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu- O=out Image.gz qcom/sdm636-onyx-noteair.dtb modules

Commits made with AI assistance carry an Assisted-by: trailer. They are not
submitted upstream; see the GlassineOS contribution policy.
